      "writtenOn": "2024-05-03T22:29:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wouldn\u0027t expect the flags to be exported to cc, just a single \"combine these rust staticlibs\" function.  It\u0027s hard to tell how much duplication that would require in order to map that to a call to the right `Transform*` function in builder.go.  The flags seem relatively simple, maybe pull a little bit of `baseCompiler.compilerFlags` into a helper function that could be called outside a rust module.  `depsToPaths` seems like the harder part, but again most of that seems independent of the rust module and is mostly just looking at dependencies and filling out a `PathDeps`, maybe that could be factored out too.",
